		(property "Description" "Wisecoco 7\" (6.97\") 1920x1080 HDMI display board with capacitive touch (STACK v2 2.6, behind the written-answers gate). Only the interfaces STACK uses are drawn: HDMI IN (Adafruit 2420 cable from the Q6A HDMI), touch USB \"USB TP\" (D+/D-/GND only to Q6A J2a = FE1.1s P2; VBUS never connected), DC input from DISP12. Port IDs are symbolic: the board pinout is not published (pinout UNCONFIRMED). KEY/OSD and Backlight connectors not drawn (GP17 path TBD)."
			(at 375.92 116.84 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(pin "DC+"
			(uuid "6b99bf5b-7995-4fdd-bcef-7e39817c674b")
